isual inspection at multiple points on the same program; no controller alarm generated.", "chunk_ids": ["0b14b916-5539-4d26-b13b-697f35917e97"], "id": "symptom:weld-location deviation noted during in-process visual inspection at multiple points on the same program; no controller alarm generated."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "An unintended program point altered during the manual jog itself; fixture not fully re-seated after the jam was cleared; mastering drift coincidentally present from an unrelated cause.", "chunk_ids": ["0b14b916-5539-4d26-b13b-697f35917e97"], "id": "root_cause:an unintended program point altered during the manual jog itself; fixture not fully re-seated after the jam was cleared; mastering drift coincidentally present from an unrelated cause."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Re-homed robot and corrected affected program points; ran full dry cycle before resuming production.", "chunk_ids": ["0b14b916-5539-4d26-b13b-697f35917e97"], "id": "solution:re-homed robot and corrected affected program points; ran full dry cycle before resuming production."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot I/O Card", "chunk_ids": ["0b566365-7578-4430-8405-3515723693a7"], "id": "component:robot i/o card"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Robot stopped mid-cycle at varying points in the program; fault cleared reliably on reset with no repeat within the same shift on most occasions; no pattern found linking the stop to a specific weld point or motion type.", "chunk_ids": ["0b566365-7578-4430-8405-3515723693a7"], "id": "symptom:robot stopped mid-cycle at varying points in the program; fault cleared reliably on reset with no repeat within the same shift on most occasions; no pattern found linking the stop to a specific weld point or motion type."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Electrical noise from nearby welding operations occasionally affecting a marginal I/O card connection; a developing fault within the I/O card itself; a loose backplane connector unrelated to 