during extended runs as a practical mitigation.", "chunk_ids": ["1787e645-c8c7-4d0a-962e-0b2ac99f75bd"], "id": "solution:implemented a scheduled brief cool-down pause during extended runs as a practical mitigation."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Cable Strain Relief", "chunk_ids": ["186ca9bb-a4f6-44dd-8073-29d631991313"], "id": "component:gun cable strain relief"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Brief gun-ready signal dropout logged intermittently; robot occasionally paused momentarily waiting for signal confirmation before proceeding normally; no consistent pattern to timing or frequency.", "chunk_ids": ["186ca9bb-a4f6-44dd-8073-29d631991313"], "id": "symptom:brief gun-ready signal dropout logged intermittently; robot occasionally paused momentarily waiting for signal confirmation before proceeding normally; no consistent pattern to timing or frequency."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Connector pin wear from repeated micro-movement; electrical noise from nearby welding current occasionally affecting the signal; a second, unrelated marginal connection elsewhere in the same signal path.", "chunk_ids": ["186ca9bb-a4f6-44dd-8073-29d631991313"], "id": "root_cause:connector pin wear from repeated micro-movement; electrical noise from nearby welding current occasionally affecting the signal; a second, unrelated marginal connection elsewhere in the same signal path."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Re-secured cable strain relief; re-terminated associated connector; extended monitoring period to confirm resolution.", "chunk_ids": ["186ca9bb-a4f6-44dd-8073-29d631991313"], "id": "solution:re-secured cable strain relief; re-terminated associated connector; extended monitoring period to confirm resolution."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Welding Controller Ground Fault Protection", "chunk_ids": ["2064bb55-ffca-45af-833e-00e29217bf17"], "id": "component:welding controller ground fault protection"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Ground fault protection trip indicati