o obstruction, misalignment, or personnel presence found on inspection each time; trips occurring at no clearly identifiable interval."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "A marginal wiring connection elsewhere in the safety circuit unrelated to the relay itself; electrical noise coupling into the safety circuit from nearby equipment; the light curtain's own internal electronics beginning to fail intermittently.", "chunk_ids": ["253dfe62-6ff0-443a-96f4-7dea49325499"], "id": "root_cause:a marginal wiring connection elsewhere in the safety circuit unrelated to the relay itself; electrical noise coupling into the safety circuit from nearby equipment; the light curtain's own internal electronics beginning to fail intermittently."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced worn safety relay with a correctly rated component; verified full safety-circuit function per test procedure.", "chunk_ids": ["253dfe62-6ff0-443a-96f4-7dea49325499"], "id": "solution:replaced worn safety relay with a correctly rated component; verified full safety-circuit function per test procedure."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Dress Pack", "chunk_ids": ["25ac1acb-4059-4c9d-a524-3ad6504ac71d"], "id": "component:robot dress pack"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible abrasion and thinning of dress-pack outer sheathing; no operational fault present at time of discovery.", "chunk_ids": ["25ac1acb-4059-4c9d-a524-3ad6504ac71d"], "id": "symptom:visible abrasion and thinning of dress-pack outer sheathing; no operational fault present at time of discovery."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Clamp bracket loosened over time; cable bundle diameter increased slightly from a prior repair, reducing clearance; program motion range recently expanded at that joint.", "chunk_ids": ["25ac1acb-4059-4c9d-a524-3ad6504ac71d"], "id": "root_cause:clamp bracket loosened over time; cable bundle diameter increased slightly from a prior repair, reducing clearance; program motion range recently expanded at that joint."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced affected dress-pack section; added clamp point to reduce cable movement at the junction.", "chunk_ids": ["25ac1acb-4059-4c9d-a524-3ad6504ac71d"], "id": "solution:replaced affected dress-pack section; added clamp point to reduce cable movement at the junction."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 6 / Wrist Cabling", "chunk_ids": ["29defb87-521f-4a5b-800b-f3238d614865"], "id": "component:robot axis 6 / wrist cabling"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Brief sensor-signal-loss indication on the teach pendant; robot did not always stop, but the event was logged; no consistent correlation to a specific program or time of day noted initially.", "chunk_ids": ["29defb87-521f-4a5b-800b-f3238d614865"], "id": "symptom:brief sensor-signal-loss indication on the teach pendant; robot did not always stop, but the event was logged; no consistent correlation to a specific program or time of day noted initially."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Connector housing seal degraded, allowing moisture/contaminant ingress; cable strain at the wrist from repeated rotation; electrical noise from nearby welding current coincidentally correlating with some events.", "chunk_ids": ["29defb87-521f-4a5b-800b-f3238d614865"], "id": "root_cause:connector housing seal degraded, allowing moisture/contaminant ingress; cable strain at the wrist from repeated rotation; electrical noise from nearby welding current coincidentally correlating with some events."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Cleaned and re-terminated wrist connector; applied corrosion-resistant contact treatment; extended monitoring period to confirm resolution.", "chunk_ids": ["29defb87-521f-4a5b-800b-f3238d614865"], "id": "solution:cleaned and re-terminated wrist connector; applied corrosion-resistant contact treatment; extended monitoring period to confirm resolution."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Plant Compressed Air Quality", "chunk_ids": ["2caed120-b4df-42bc-b46e-4ed3b2efb0ee"]