ion verification against a reference standard; production weld-quality metrics had not yet shown a corresponding deviation at time of discovery."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Current transformer/sensor component aging; electrical noise affecting the reference comparison itself; a prior repair inadvertently affecting calibration without a follow-up verification.", "chunk_ids": ["2d08e321-cc07-4bad-b7e7-b6ad99b8b51e"], "id": "root_cause:current transformer/sensor component aging; electrical noise affecting the reference comparison itself; a prior repair inadvertently affecting calibration without a follow-up verification."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Performed full current-feedback recalibration against certified reference; verified accuracy across production current range.", "chunk_ids": ["2d08e321-cc07-4bad-b7e7-b6ad99b8b51e"], "id": "solution:performed full current-feedback recalibration against certified reference; verified accuracy across production current range."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Force Sensor", "chunk_ids": ["2e652c22-cf5e-4820-970a-60723985171f"], "id": "component:gun force sensor"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Force-feedback readings below setpoint on flagged cycles, inconsistent from cycle to cycle; no complete loss of clamp function, distinguishing this from a full close-failure symptom.", "chunk_ids": ["2e652c22-cf5e-4820-970a-60723985171f"], "id": "symptom:force-feedback readings below setpoint on flagged cycles, inconsistent from cycle to cycle; no complete loss of clamp function, distinguishing this from a full close-failure symptom."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Mechanical looseness in the force sensor's mounting affecting reading accuracy; servo force-control parameter drift independent of the sensor; electrode wear changing the force-to-quality relationship without a true force deviation.", "chunk_ids": ["2e652c22-cf5e-4820-970a-60723985171f"], "id": "root_cause:mechanical looseness in the force sensor's mounting affecting reading accuracy; servo force-control parameter drift independent of the sensor; electrode wear changing the force-to-quality relationship without a true force deviation."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Performed force-sensor calibration against certified reference; verified force delivery across setpoint range.", "chunk_ids": ["2e652c22-cf5e-4820-970a-60723985171f"], "id": "solution:performed force-sensor calibration against certified reference; verified force delivery across setpoint range."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Electrode Holder / Cooling Passage", "chunk_ids": ["315d96f0-8bbf-406e-9ba3-53693b21b988"], "id": "component:electrode holder / cooling passage"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible steam/water presence at the weld point during clamping; occasional weld-quality irregularity on affected cycles, distinct from a simple external fitting leak since the water entered the weld zone directly.", "chunk_ids": ["315d96f0-8bbf-406e-9ba3-53693b21b988"], "id": "symptom:visible steam/water presence at the weld point during clamping; occasional weld-quality irregularity on affected cycles, distinct from a simple external fitting leak since the water entered the weld zone directly."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "A manufacturing defect or casting flaw in the holder body; excessive clamp force accelerating fatigue at a stress concentration point; holder installed past its typical service life without proactive replacement.", "chunk_ids": ["315d96f0-8bbf-406e-9ba3-53693b21b988"], "id": "root_cause:a manufacturing defect or casting flaw in the holder body; excessive clamp force accelerating fatigue at a stress concentration point; holder installed past its typical service life without proactive replacement."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced cracked electrode holder; pressure-tested new unit before returning to service.", "chunk_ids": ["315d96f0-8bbf-406e-9ba3-53693b21b988"], "id": "solution:replaced cracked electrode holder; pressure-tested new unit before returning to service."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Equalizer Function", "chunk_ids": ["383902db-3c55-46fc-b008-12672d664bc6"], "id": "component:gun equalizer function"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible surface marking/light denting near several weld points on the angled surface; no gun fault or alarm generated, since the gun completed its cycle mechanically without issue.", "chunk_ids": ["383902db-3c55-46fc-b008-12672d664bc6"], "id": "symptom:visible surface marking/light denting near several weld points on the angled surface; no gun fault or alarm generated, since the gun completed its cycle mechanically without issue."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Equalizer cylinder response time slowed by internal wear, compounding the angle-compensation shortfall; robot approach angle slightly steeper than the original program design intended; panel angle itself varying from the nominal design at this point.", "chunk_ids": ["383902db-3c55-46fc-b008-12672d664bc6"], "id": "root_cause:equalizer cylinder response time slowed by internal wear, compounding the angle-compensation shortfall; robot approach angle slightly steeper than the original program design intended; panel angle itself varying from the nominal design at this point."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Adjusted robot approach angle; verified equalizer cylinder response; confirmed elimination of surface marking on verification run.", "chunk_ids": ["383902db-3c55-46fc-b008-12672d664bc6"], "id": "solution:adjusted robot approach angle; verified equalizer cylinder response; confirmed elimination of surface marking on verification run."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Secondary Cable / Insulation", "chunk_ids": ["420467a8-ebdf-4710-9315-b3453b6a060d"], "id": "component:gun secondary cable / insulation"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible arcing/sparking at a specific point along the secondary cable during weld cycles; small burn/scorch mark on the cable jacket at that 