-9d77d19f26e6"], "id": "root_cause:software travel-limit boundary itself set conservatively relative to the true mechanical limit, unnecessarily restricting a valid path; a units or coordinate-system error in the new waypoint definition."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Revised waypoint to remain within software travel limit; verified with repeated slow-speed test moves before release.", "chunk_ids": ["4a39b1e4-eca2-476d-921c-9d77d19f26e6"], "id": "solution:revised waypoint to remain within software travel limit; verified with repeated slow-speed test moves before release."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Secondary Contactor", "chunk_ids": ["4ba96b4b-492f-4752-8c37-fa1ae5d6b918"], "id": "component:secondary contactor"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Delivered current consistently below setpoint on the welding controller's own current-feedback display, affecting essentially all cycles rather than a subset; slight audible chatter noted from the contactor area during weld pulses.", "chunk_ids": ["4ba96b4b-492f-4752-8c37-fa1ae5d6b918"], "id": "symptom:delivered current consistently below setpoint on the welding controller's own current-feedback display, affecting essentially all cycles rather than a subset; slight audible chatter noted from the contactor area during weld pulses."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Contactor coil marginal, causing incomplete contact closure; contactor approaching end of rated switching-cycle life; contamination on contact surfaces from the weld-cell environment.", "chunk_ids": ["4ba96b4b-492f-4752-8c37-fa1ae5d6b918"], "id": "root_cause:contactor coil marginal, causing incomplete contact closure; contactor approaching end of rated switching-cycle life; contamination on contact surfaces from the weld-cell environment."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced worn secondary contactor; verified current output returned to setpoint.", "chunk_ids": ["4ba96b4b-492f-4752-8c37-fa1ae5d6b918"], "id": "solution:replaced worn secondary contactor; verified current output returned to setpoint."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Servo Brake", "chunk_ids": ["4db62379-6cca-436e-96a1-656b832f150e"], "id": "component:gun servo brake"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible slow sag of the gun arm during idle periods; no impact on active production since the gun repositioned correctly at the start of each new cycle, but flagged as an emerging brake-related concern.", "chunk_ids": ["4db62379-6cca-436e-96a1-656b832f150e"], "id": "symptom:visible slow sag of the gun arm during idle periods; no impact on active production since the gun repositioned correctly at the start of each new cycle, but flagged as an emerging brake-related concern."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Brake engagement timing parameter drifted; contamination on the brake friction surface; brake mechanical linkage wear similar to a robot-axis brake wear pattern but specific to the gun servo.", "chunk_ids": ["4db62379-6cca-436e-96a1-656b832f150e"], "id": "root_cause:brake engagement timing parameter drifted; contamination on the brake friction surface; brake mechanical linkage wear similar to a robot-axis brake wear pattern but specific to the gun servo."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced worn gun servo brake components; verified holding performance during idle periods after service.", "chunk_ids": ["4db62379-6cca-436e-96a1-656b832f150e"], "id": "solution:replaced worn gun servo brake components; verified holding performance during idle periods after service."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Program Logic / Gun Offset Data", "chunk_ids": ["54390e9d-e9ed-4125-bdab-e1e485b74760"], "id": "component:robot program logic / gun offset data"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Current-spike flags and gun servo overload cautionary indications occurring together on the same small batch of parts immediately following the program change; both symptoms disappeared once the correct offset was applied on later parts.", "chunk_ids": ["54390e9d-e9ed-4125-bdab-e1e485b74760"], "id": "symptom:current-spike flags and gun servo overload cautionary indications occurring together on the same small batch of parts immediately following the program change; both symptoms disappeared once the correct offset was applied on later parts."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "A timing race condition between the variant-selection signal and the offset-lookup routine; an operator selecting the new variant before the offset table was fully updated; a data-entry error in the new variant's offset value that happened to resemble a logic gap.", "chunk_ids": ["54390e9d-e9ed-4125-bdab-e1e485b74760"], "id": "root_cause:a timing race condition between the variant-selection signal and the offset-lookup routine; an operator selecting the new variant before the offset table was fully updated; a data-entry error in the new variant's offset value that happened to resemble a logic gap."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Corrected program-selection logic for gun-offset assignment; verified across multiple variant-change test cycles before release.", "chunk_ids": ["54390e9d-e9ed-4125-bdab-e1e485b74760"], "id": "solution:corrected program-selection logic for gun-offset assignment; verified across multiple variant-change test cycles before release."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Welding Controller Firmware / Schedule Table", "chunk_ids": ["59d92432-aec8-44ee-a68f-3d71c35b09af"], "id": "component:welding controller firmware / schedule table"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Weld-schedule parameter values (current, time, force references) differing from the documented pre-update configuration on a subset of schedules; no consistent pattern to which schedules were affected.", "chunk_ids": ["59d92432-aec8-44ee-a68f-3d71c35b09af"], "id": "symptom:weld-schedule parameter values (current, time, force references) differing from the documented pre-update configuration on a subset of schedules; no consistent pattern to which schedules were affected."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Backup schedule data used for restoration was itself outdated; a manual entry error during a prior schedule edit that only became apparent after the update reset display formatting; incomplete update installation.", "chunk_ids": ["59d92432-aec8-44ee-a68f-3d71c35b09af"], "id": "root_cause:backup schedule data used for restoration was itself outdated; a manual entry error during a prior schedule edit that only became apparent after the update reset display formatting; incomplete update installation."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Restored affected schedules from verified backup; cross-checked all schedules against documentation; performed destructive testing on first-off parts.", "chunk_ids": ["59d92432-aec8-44ee-a68f-3d71c35b09af"], "id": "solution:restored affected schedules from verified backup; cross-checked all schedules against documentation; performed destructive testing on first-off parts."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Base Mounting", "chunk_ids": ["5a90d5a5-5d3d-49b1-8d8c-b677c0f50e2f"], "id": "component:robot base mounting"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Under-torque reading on one base mounting bolt during routine torque-check PM; no visible movement, noise, or position deviation reported by production at time of discovery.", "chunk_ids": ["5a90d5a5-5d3d-49b1-8d8c-b677c0f50e2f"], "id": "symptom:under-torque reading on one base mounting bolt during routine torque-check pm; no visible movement, noise, or position deviation reported by production at time of discovery."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Bolt not torqued to full specification during a prior service event; mounting surface condition allowing slight settling over time.", "chunk_ids": ["5a90d5a5-5d3d-49b1-8d8c-b677c0f50e2f"], "id": "root_cause:bolt not torqued to full specification during a prior service event; mounting surface condition allowing slight settling over time."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Re-torqued affected bolt to specification; verified all other base mounting bolts during the same inspection.", "chunk_ids": ["5a90d5a5-5d3d-49b1-8d8c-b677c0f50e2f"], "id": "solution:re-torqued affected bolt to specification; verified all other base mounting bolts during the same inspection."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Pneumatic Regulator", "chunk_ids": ["5b96ef36-122e-4d2e-9427-288e5487fd44"], "id": "component:gun pneumatic regulator"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Increased weld splash noted on visual inspection combined with occasional gun servo high-load cautionary indications, both appearing together starting from the shift following the regulator adjustment.", "chunk_ids": ["5b96ef36-122e-4d2e-9427-288e5487fd44"], "id": "symptom:increased weld splash noted on visual inspection combined with occasional gun servo high-load cautionary indications, both appearing together starting from the shift following the regulator adjustment."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Regulator gauge reading inaccurately, leading to an unintentional over-adjustment; a second, coincidental gun mechanical issue independently contributing to splash; weld schedule current setting also slightly high, compounding the effect of excess force.", "chunk_ids": ["5b96ef36-122e-4d2e-9427-288e5487fd44"], "id": "root_cause:regulator gauge reading inaccurately, leading to an unintentional over-adjustment; a second, coincidental gun mechanical issue independently contributing to splash; weld schedule current setting also slightly high, compounding the effect of excess force."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Corrected pneumatic regulator setting to specification; verified clamp force and confirmed both symptoms resolved.", "chunk_ids": ["5b96ef36-122e-4d2e-9427-288e5487fd44"], "id": "solution:corrected pneumatic regulator setting to specification; verified clamp force and confirmed both symptoms resolved."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Central Cooling Tower", "chunk_ids": ["5bcadfa4-f833-4ab1-926e-eaf371f5f604"], "id": "component:central cooling tower"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Gradual, multi-day rise in cooling-water supply temperature across many stations rather than a single-station event; several stations showing early-stage thermal cautionary indications by the time the cause was found.", "chunk_ids": ["5bcadfa4-f833-4ab1-926e-eaf371f5f604"], "id": "symptom:gradual, multi-day rise in cooling-water supply temperature across many stations rather than a single-station event; several stations showing early-stage thermal cautionary indications by the time the cause was found."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Tower fan motor itself degrading independent of the belt; scale buildup on tower fill media reducing efficiency; increased overall plant cooling load during the affected period.", "chunk_ids": ["5bcadfa4-f833-4ab1-926e-eaf371f5f604"], "id": "root_cause:tower fan motor itself degrading independent of the belt; scale buildup on tower fill media reducing efficiency; increased overall plant cooling load during the affected period."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Facilities replaced cooling-tower fan belt; verified fan speed/airflow and confirmed supply temperature returned to normal across affected stations.", "chunk_ids": ["5bcadfa4-f833-4ab1-926e-eaf371f5f604"], "id": "solution:facilities replaced cooling-tower fan belt; verified fan speed/airflow and confirmed supply temperature returned to normal across affected stations."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Welding Controller Communication Watchdog", "chunk_ids": ["66d7ccb6-b51a-4a19-af8a-9ab0e256ce98"], "id": "component:welding controller communication watchdog"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Occasional missed-weld events discovered during downstream inspection, not always accompanied by an obvious stoppage since the robot sometimes continued rather than halting; watchdog timeout logged intermittently on the welding controller side.", "chunk_ids": ["66d7ccb6-b51a-4a19-af8a-9ab0e256ce98"], "id": "symptom:occasional missed-weld events discovered during downstream inspection, not always accompanied by an obvious stoppage since the robot sometimes continued rather than halting; watchdog timeout logged intermittently on the welding controller side."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "A marginal interface connector contributing genuine intermittent delay; occasional processing load on the welding controller slowing its response during specific cycle conditions; a robot-side logic gap allowing progression without a hard weld-confirmation interlock.", "chunk_ids": ["66d7ccb6-b51a-4a19-af8a-9ab0e256ce98"], "id": "root_cause:a marginal interface connector contributing genuine intermittent delay; occasional processing load on the welding controller slowing its response during specific cycle conditions; a robot-side logic gap allowing progression without a hard weld-confirmation interlock."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Adjusted watchdog timeout parameter with adequate margin; verified robot-side logic hard-stops on timeout rather than proceeding; completed traceback and rework.", "chunk_ids": ["66d7ccb6-b51a-4a19-af8a-9ab0e256ce98"], "id": "solution:adjusted watchdog timeout parameter with adequate margin; verified robot-side logic hard-stops on timeout rather than proceeding; completed traceback and rework."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Communication Network", "chunk_ids": ["6b667876-78e2-4d88-bd7d-d261f7365db5"], "id": "component:robot communication network"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Multiple stations stopped within moments of each other; each affected robot controller showed a communication-loss indication; the shared network switch showed no active status lights.", "chunk_ids": ["6b667876-78e2-4d88-bd7d-d261f7365db5"], "id": "symptom:multiple stations stopped within moments of each other; each affected robot controller showed a communication-loss indication; the shared network switch showed no active status lights."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Switch overheating due to inadequate cabinet ventilation; a firmware fault on the switch; an external power disturbance affecting the switch specifically.", "chunk_ids": ["6b667876-78e2-4d88-bd7d-d261f7365db5"], "id": "root_cause:switch overheating due to inadequate cabinet ventilation; a firmware fault on the switch; an external power disturbance affecting the switch specifically."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced failed network switch; restored configuration; verified communication and ran verification cycles at each affected station.", "chunk_ids": ["6b667876-78e2-4d88-bd7d-d261f7365db5"], "id": "solution:replaced failed network switch; restored configuration; verified communication and ran verification cycles at each affected station."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 4 / Servo Drive", "chunk_ids": ["6d2241de-aaab-493e-a77d-ec7204c0b44f"], "id": "component:robot axis 4 / servo drive"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Robot stopped mid-lift; servo drive fault indicator active; unusual mechanical resistance noted when the axis was later jogged manually at slow speed.", "chunk_ids": ["6d2241de-aaab-493e-a77d-ec7204c0b44f"], "id": "symptom:robot stopped mid-lift; servo drive fault indicator active; unusual mechanical resistance noted when the axis was later jogged manually at slow speed."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Counterbalance mechanism (if equipped) not providing expected assist; incorrect payload parameter after a recent tooling change; servo drive current-limit parameter set conservatively for the application.", "chunk_ids": ["6d2241de-aaab-493e-a77d-ec7204c0b44f"], "id": "root_cause:counterbalance mechanism (if equipped) not providing expected assist; incorrect payload parameter after a recent tooling change; servo drive current-limit parameter set conservatively for the application."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Reduced lift speed as an interim measure; scheduled gearbox/bearing inspection and service at next planned downtime.", "chunk_ids": ["6d2241de-aaab-493e-a77d-ec7204c0b44f"], "id": "solution:reduced lift speed as an interim measure; scheduled gearbox/bearing inspection and service at next planned downtime."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Electrode Cap", "chunk_ids": ["71e63f4e-7382-4c11-aa0f-0ea165a31d1d"], "id": "component:electrode cap"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Excessive spatter/splash observed at the weld point; electrode cap visibly deformed and oversized compared to a freshly dressed cap; weld appearance inconsistent across recent parts.", "chunk_ids": ["71e63f4e-7382-4c11-aa0f-0ea165a31d1d"], "id": "symptom:excessive spatter/splash observed at the weld point; electrode cap visibly deformed and oversized compared to a freshly dressed cap; weld appearance inconsistent across recent parts."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Electrode alignment slightly off, concentrating heat unevenly on the cap face; panel coating variation increasing splash tendency; dress-tool producing a less durable tip geometry at the last dress cycle.", "chunk_ids": ["71e63f4e-7382-4c11-aa0f-0ea165a31d1d"], "id": "root_cause:electrode alignment slightly off, concentrating heat unevenly on the cap face; panel coating variation increasing splash tendency; dress-tool producing a less durable tip geometry at the last dress cycle."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Dressed electrode; adjusted weld-current setting for the material stack; monitored subsequent run for confirmation.", "chunk_ids": ["71e63f4e-7382-4c11-aa0f-0ea165a31d1d"], "id": "solution:dressed electrode; adjusted weld-current setting for the material stack; monitored subsequent run for confirmation."}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Loud mechanical contact sound; robot stopped abruptly with elevated torque indication on the approaching axis; visible scuff mark on gun/tooling near the contact point.", "chunk_ids": ["72d82311-810b-490f-bd32-8ad22ab4345c"], "id": "symptom:loud mechanical contact sound; robot stopped abruptly with elevated torque indication on the approaching axis; visible scuff mark on gun/tooling near the contact point."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Fixture pin installed slightly out of its intended location; program clearance margin at that point already minimal before the change; operator resumed automatic mode without a mandatory dry-run check.", "chunk_ids": ["72d82311-810b-490f-bd32-8ad22ab4345c"], "id": "root_cause:fixture pin installed slightly out of its intended location; program clearance margin at that point already minimal before the change; operator resumed automatic mode without a mandatory dry-run check."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Adjusted approach waypoint for clearance; verified with manual dry run at reduced speed before resuming full-speed automatic cycle.", "chunk_ids": ["72d82311-810b-490f-bd32-8ad22ab4345c"], "id": "solution:adjusted approach waypoint for clearance; verified with manual dry run at reduced speed before resuming full-speed automatic cycle."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 2 / Brake", "chunk_ids": ["7f0a550c-238c-4a74-8052-f538581ad9eb"], "id": "component:robot axis 2 / brake"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Brief, small downward arm movement immediately after power-down command, before settling; no alarm generated since this occurred after the automatic-mode fault-monitoring window had effectively ended.", "chunk_ids": ["7f0a550c-238c-4a74-8052-f538581ad9eb"], "id": "symptom:brief, small downward arm movement immediately after power-down command, before settling; no alarm generated since this occurred after the automatic-mode fault-monitoring window had effectively ended."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Brake engagement timing parameter drifted from specification; contamination on the brake friction surface; brake mechanical linkage wear.", "chunk_ids": ["7f0a550c-238c-4a74-8052-f538581ad9eb"], "id": "root_cause:brake engagement timing parameter drifted from specification; contamination on the brake friction surface; brake mechanical linkage wear."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced worn Axis 2 brake components; verified holding performance across repeated power-down cycles.", "chunk_ids": ["7f0a550c-238c-4a74-8052-f538581ad9eb"], "id": "solution:replaced worn axis 2 brake components; verified holding performance across repeated power-down cycles."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Electrode Tip / Panel Interface", "chunk_ids": ["84991267-3ab2-48d8-bf72-7d7625f4e18f"], "id": "component:electrode tip / panel interface"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Occasional delayed gun-open confirmation, correlating specifically with parts showing upstream coating overspray; not present on parts without visible overspray, making the fault appear intermittent when viewed station-wide.", "chunk_ids": ["84991267-3ab2-48d8-bf72-7d7625f4e18f"], "id": "symptom:occasional delayed gun-open confirmation, correlating specifically with parts showing upstream coating overspray; not present on parts without visible overspray, making the fault appear intermittent when viewed station-wide."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Electrode tip wear compounding the adhesion tendency on affected parts; weld schedule slightly over-heating the joint, worsened by the contamination; upstream coating process itself out of specification.", "chunk_ids": ["84991267-3ab2-48d8-bf72-7d7625f4e18f"], "id": "root_cause:electrode tip wear compounding the adhesion tendency on affected parts; weld schedule slightly over-heating the joint, worsened by the contamination; upstream coating process itself out of specification."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Cleaned electrode tip; coordinated with upstream process to correct coating overspray at the source.", "chunk_ids": ["84991267-3ab2-48d8-bf72-7d7625f4e18f"], "id": "solution:cleaned electrode tip; coordinated with upstream process to correct coating overspray at the source."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Controller / Internal Power Supply", "chunk_ids": ["8c2c9106-4069-436f-97c3-b41c86195c96"], "id": "component:robot controller / internal power supply"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Controller display went dark and restarted; robot lost its automatic-mode status and required full restart procedure; no external power event logged by facility monitoring at either occurrence.", "chunk_ids": ["8c2c9106-4069-436f-97c3-b41c86195c96"], "id": "symptom:controller display went dark and restarted; robot lost its automatic-mode status and required full restart procedure; no external power event logged by facility monitoring at either occurrence."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Controller internal cooling fan degraded, allowing localized overheating; a loose internal connector within the controller cabinet; software/firmware anomaly unrelated to the power supply.", "chunk_ids": ["8c2c9106-4069-436f-97c3-b41c86195c96"], "id": "root_cause:controller internal cooling fan degraded, allowing localized overheating; a loose internal connector within the controller cabinet; software/firmware anomaly unrelated to the power supply."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Scheduled and performed internal power supply inspection/replacement; verified stability over an extended monitoring period.", "chunk_ids": ["8c2c9106-4069-436f-97c3-b41c86195c96"], "id": "solution:scheduled and performed internal power supply inspection/replacement; verified stability over an extended monitoring period."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Mastering / Electrode Wear Interaction", "chunk_ids": ["944c2e9f-ad7a-42cd-82a2-ca71f518f98c"], "id": "component:robot mastering / electrode wear interaction"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Weld nugget size on destructive testing acceptable early in each electrode dress interval but trending toward the low end of acceptable, and occasionally below limit, later in each interval \u2014 a pattern that had not existed before the Axis 5 service event.", "chunk_ids": ["944c2e9f-ad7a-42cd-82a2-ca71f518f98c"], "id": "symptom:weld nugget size on destructive testing acceptable early in each electrode dress interval but trending toward the low end of acceptable, and occasionally below limit, later in each interval \u2014 a pattern that had not existed before the axis 5 service event."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "The re-mastering procedure itself performed correctly but using a reference point with slightly more variability than ideal; weld schedule margin at this point already narrow before the service event; fixture wear at this point independently contributing a small additional offset.", "chunk_ids": ["944c2e9f-ad7a-42cd-82a2-ca71f518f98c"], "id": "root_cause:the re-mastering procedure itself performed correctly but using a reference point with slightly more variability than ideal; weld schedule margin at this point already narrow before the service event; fixture wear at this point independently contributing a small additional offset."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Fine-tuned mastering reference at the affected point; shortened electrode dress interval; verified with a full dress-interval destructive-test cycle.", "chunk_ids": ["944c2e9f-ad7a-42cd-82a2-ca71f518f98c"], "id": "solution:fine-tuned mastering reference at the affected point; shortened electrode dress interval; verified with a full dress-interval destructive-test cycle."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Fieldbus Network Switch", "chunk_ids": ["964ab3af-cc45-45a7-9d4d-a15a84f09a72"], "id": "component:fieldbus network switch"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Brief, intermittent communication dropouts affecting multiple stations simultaneously; events more frequent during afternoon periods when the electrical cabinet area ran warmer, though not perfectly consistent.", "chunk_ids": ["964ab3af-cc45-45a7-9d4d-a15a84f09a72"], "id": "symptom:brief, intermittent communication dropouts affecting multiple stations simultaneously; events more frequent during afternoon periods when the electrical cabinet area ran warmer, though not perfectly consistent."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Switch itself nearing end of reliable service life, with thermal sensitivity as an early symptom; a blocked or dirty cabinet ventilation filter reducing airflow; an external heat source near the cabinet contributing to elevated ambient temperature.", "chunk_ids": ["964ab3af-cc45-45a7-9d4d-a15a84f09a72"], "id": "root_cause:switch itself nearing end of reliable service life, with thermal sensitivity as an early symptom; a blocked or dirty cabinet ventilation filter reducing airflow; an external heat source near the cabinet contributing to elevated ambient temperature."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Improved cabinet ventilation and switch positioning; extended monitoring period confirmed resolution; scheduled proactive switch replacement.", "chunk_ids": ["964ab3af-cc45-45a7-9d4d-a15a84f09a72"], "id": "solution:improved cabinet ventilation and switch positioning; extended monitoring period confirmed resolution; scheduled proactive switch replacement."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Program Storage / Backup", "chunk_ids": ["acaa091c-6458-45a4-9a7f-fe60b45d3df2"], "id": "component:robot program storage / backup"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Controller displayed a program integrity/checksum warning on restart; production held pending verification rather than assuming the program was intact.", "chunk_ids": ["acaa091c-6458-45a4-9a7f-fe60b45d3df2"], "id": "symptom:controller displayed a program integrity/checksum warning on restart; production held pending verification rather than assuming the program was intact."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Backup battery or storage medium degradation contributing to the integrity warning; the uncontrolled shutdown itself corrupting a small portion of program memory; a pre-existing backup system issue unrelated to this specific outage.", "chunk_ids": ["acaa091c-6458-45a4-9a7f-fe60b45d3df2"], "id": "root_cause:backup battery or storage medium degradation contributing to the integrity warning; the uncontrolled shutdown itself corrupting a small portion of program memory; a pre-existing backup system issue unrelated to this specific outage."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Restored program from verified backup; verified critical points and ran full dry cycle before resuming production.", "chunk_ids": ["acaa091c-6458-45a4-9a7f-fe60b45d3df2"], "id": "solution:restored program from verified backup; verified critical points and ran full dry cycle before resuming production."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Post-Maintenance Verification", "chunk_ids": ["b1665c08-5b48-42a7-abae-4fb638b6dba7"], "id": "component:post-maintenance verification"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Inconsistent nugget size across several weld points on the first parts produced after the gun swap, detected during first-off destructive inspection rather than by any controller alarm.", "chunk_ids": ["b1665c08-5b48-42a7-abae-4fb638b6dba7"], "id": "symptom:inconsistent nugget size across several weld points on the first parts produced after the gun swap, detected during first-off destructive inspection rather than by any controller alarm."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Rebuilt gun's mechanical tolerances differing slightly from the original unit; gun mounting on the robot flange not fully seated or torqued during installation; weld schedule not adjusted for a genuine, not merely uncalibrated, difference between the original and replacement gun.", "chunk_ids": ["b1665c08-5b48-42a7-abae-4fb638b6dba7"], "id": "root_cause:rebuilt gun's mechanical tolerances differing slightly from the original unit; gun mounting on the robot flange not fully seated or torqued during installation; weld schedule not adjusted for a genuine, not merely uncalibrated, difference between the original and replacement gun."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Completed force-calibration verification cycle; adjusted weld schedule where needed; performed destructive testing across affected points before release.", "chunk_ids": ["b1665c08-5b48-42a7-abae-4fb638b6dba7"], "id": "solution:completed force-calibration verification cycle; adjusted weld schedule where needed; performed destructive testing across affected points before release."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Pneumatic Solenoid Valve", "chunk_ids": ["b171ff11-4563-4a47-8a17-a22ce08f67ab"], "id": "component:gun pneumatic solenoid valve"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Gun remained fully open through the entire weld sequence window; no clamp motion observed at all, distinct from a partial-close or slow-response symptom.", "chunk_ids": ["b171ff11-4563-4a47-8a17-a22ce08f67ab"], "id": "symptom:gun remained fully open through the entire weld sequence window; no clamp motion observed at all, distinct from a partial-close or slow-response symptom."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Wiring connector at the solenoid valve damaged or disconnected; valve spool mechanically stuck from contamination; controller output driving the solenoid failed rather than the valve itself.", "chunk_ids": ["b171ff11-4563-4a47-8a17-a22ce08f67ab"], "id": "root_cause:wiring connector at the solenoid valve damaged or disconnected; valve spool mechanically stuck from contamination; controller output driving the solenoid failed rather than the valve itself."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced solenoid valve coil; verified close function across multiple test cycles.", "chunk_ids": ["b171ff11-4563-4a47-8a17-a22ce08f67ab"], "id": "solution:replaced solenoid valve coil; verified close function across multiple test cycles."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Shared Cooling Branch", "chunk_ids": ["bb61ad88-2f01-4f96-a510-1f831a579101"], "id": "component:shared cooling branch"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Increasing frequency of electrode-sticking events at the gun combined with a transformer temperature trend approaching its cautionary threshold, both first noticed within about an hour of each other.", "chunk_ids": ["bb61ad88-2f01-4f96-a510-1f831a579101"], "id": "symptom:increasing frequency of electrode-sticking events at the gun combined with a transformer temperature trend approaching its cautionary threshold, both first noticed within about an hour of each other."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Scale/debris buildup inside the shared branch piping; a valve left partially closed after unrelated prior maintenance; increased cooling demand elsewhere on the same header reducing available flow to this branch.", "chunk_ids": ["bb61ad88-2f01-4f96-a510-1f831a579101"], "id": "root_cause:scale/debris buildup inside the shared branch piping; a valve left partially closed after unrelated prior maintenance; increased cooling demand elsewhere on the same header reducing available flow to this branch."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Cleaned shared-branch strainer; verified flow restored to both gun and transformer legs individually.", "chunk_ids": ["bb61ad88-2f01-4f96-a510-1f831a579101"], "id": "solution:cleaned shared-branch strainer; verified flow restored to both gun and transformer legs individually."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Transformer Cooling Pump", "chunk_ids": ["bf893f27-3d1c-488c-9c16-83456f93113d"], "id": "component:transformer cooling pump"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Cooling pump motor protection trip indication, sometimes clearing on its own after a short delay, sometimes requiring manual reset; transformer temperature briefly rising during each interruption before recovering once flow resumed.", "chunk_ids": ["bf893f27-3d1c-488c-9c16-83456f93113d"], "id": "symptom:cooling pump motor protection trip indication, sometimes clearing on its own after a short delay, sometimes requiring manual reset; transformer temperature briefly rising during each interruption before recovering once flow resumed."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Motor protection relay set slightly too sensitive relative to true motor capability; developing impeller obstruction increasing load intermittently; voltage fluctuation at the motor supply occasionally compounding current draw.", "chunk_ids": ["bf893f27-3d1c-488c-9c16-83456f93113d"], "id": "root_cause:motor protection relay set slightly too sensitive relative to true motor capability; developing impeller obstruction increasing load intermittently; voltage fluctuation at the motor supply occasionally compounding current draw."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced cooling pump motor bearings; verified stable running current below trip threshold; extended monitoring period.", "chunk_ids": ["bf893f27-3d1c-488c-9c16-83456f93113d"], "id": "solution:replaced cooling pump motor bearings; verified stable running current below trip threshold; extended monitoring period."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 2 / Gearbox", "chunk_ids": ["c3f388a5-d832-4ab0-a95a-7ff31d056154"], "id": "component:robot axis 2 / gearbox"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Visible oil residue/light seepage at the Axis 2 gearbox seal area during PM inspection; no abnormal noise, vibration, or position fault reported at time of discovery.", "chunk_ids": ["c3f388a5-d832-4ab0-a95a-7ff31d056154"], "id": "symptom:visible oil residue/light seepage at the axis 2 gearbox seal area during pm inspection; no abnormal noise, vibration, or position fault reported at time of discovery."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Gearbox slightly overfilled during a prior service, increasing internal pressure against the seal; minor seal damage from a prior repair; elevated operating temperature accelerating seal wear.", "chunk_ids": ["c3f388a5-d832-4ab0-a95a-7ff31d056154"], "id": "root_cause:gearbox slightly overfilled during a prior service, increasing internal pressure against the seal; minor seal damage from a prior repair; elevated operating temperature accelerating seal wear."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced Axis 2 gearbox output seal; verified correct oil fill level after service.", "chunk_ids": ["c3f388a5-d832-4ab0-a95a-7ff31d056154"], "id": "solution:replaced axis 2 gearbox output seal; verified correct oil fill level after service."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Electrode Dress Counter", "chunk_ids": ["cbeff919-091c-4cc7-9b6d-abfd6bb29796"], "id": "component:electrode dress counter"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Dress-counter value found frozen at a value from several days prior when cross-checked against actual cycle counts from the welding controller; no automatic dress-triggered stoppage had occurred in the intervening period.", "chunk_ids": ["cbeff919-091c-4cc7-9b6d-abfd6bb29796"], "id": "symptom:dress-counter value found frozen at a value from several days prior when cross-checked against actual cycle counts from the welding controller; no automatic dress-triggered stoppage had occurred in the intervening period."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "A software/logic fault in the dress-counter function itself, independent of the sensor; a wiring fault between the sensor and the counter input; the counter reset event not being logged, obscuring when the fault actually began.", "chunk_ids": ["cbeff919-091c-4cc7-9b6d-abfd6bb29796"], "id": "root_cause:a software/logic fault in the dress-counter function itself, independent of the sensor; a wiring fault between the sensor and the counter input; the counter reset event not being logged, obscuring when the fault actually began."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Repaired cycle-count sensor; verified counter increment function; performed precautionary dress and destructive test on affected parts.", "chunk_ids": ["cbeff919-091c-4cc7-9b6d-abfd6bb29796"], "id": "solution:repaired cycle-count sensor; verified counter increment function; performed precautionary dress and destructive test on affected parts."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 3 / Mechanical", "chunk_ids": ["d25507f5-88d7-47d2-8e99-024ee1a97c52"], "id": "component:robot axis 3 / mechanical"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Audible thump at end of stroke; visible short-duration vibration of the forearm; no alarm generated, symptom purely mechanical/audible.", "chunk_ids": ["d25507f5-88d7-47d2-8e99-024ee1a97c52"], "id": "symptom:audible thump at end of stroke; visible short-duration vibration of the forearm; no alarm generated, symptom purely mechanical/audible."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Loose mounting hardware at the Axis 3 housing; servo tuning deceleration profile more aggressive than the mechanical system comfortably supports; early bearing wear contributing to the free play.", "chunk_ids": ["d25507f5-88d7-47d2-8e99-024ee1a97c52"], "id": "root_cause:loose mounting hardware at the axis 3 housing; servo tuning deceleration profile more aggressive than the mechanical system comfortably supports; early bearing wear contributing to the free play."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Reduced deceleration aggressiveness as an interim measure; scheduled gearbox backlash inspection and service.", "chunk_ids": ["d25507f5-88d7-47d2-8e99-024ee1a97c52"], "id": "solution:reduced deceleration aggressiveness as an interim measure; scheduled gearbox backlash inspection and service."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Approach Path / Gun Alignment / Welding Circuit", "chunk_ids": ["d2f4ee59-e3e9-4b16-a4fc-3b2b221a1b6e"], "id": "component:robot approach path / gun alignment / welding circuit"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Weld-current trend showing gradually increasing variability at one point; when investigated, electrode wear at that point was found uneven (more wear on one side of the tip) rather than the typical even mushrooming pattern; robot position check subsequently found a small consistent angular deviation.", "chunk_ids": ["d2f4ee59-e3e9-4b16-a4fc-3b2b221a1b6e"], "id": "symptom:weld-current trend showing gradually increasing variability at one point; when investigated, electrode wear at that point was found uneven (more wear on one side of the tip) rather than the typical even mushrooming pattern; robot position check subsequently found a small consistent angular deviation."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Fixture wear at this specific point contributing to the effective approach angle; gun mounting on the robot flange slightly out of square from a prior service event; panel fit-up variation at this point compounding the angle effect.", "chunk_ids": ["d2f4ee59-e3e9-4b16-a4fc-3b2b221a1b6e"], "id": "root_cause:fixture wear at this specific point contributing to the effective approach angle; gun mounting on the robot flange slightly out of square from a prior service event; panel fit-up variation at this point compounding the angle effect."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Corrected robot approach-path angle; dressed electrode to restore even geometry; confirmed current-variability trend stabilized over following week.", "chunk_ids": ["d2f4ee59-e3e9-4b16-a4fc-3b2b221a1b6e"], "id": "solution:corrected robot approach-path angle; dressed electrode to restore even geometry; confirmed current-variability trend stabilized over following week."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Plant Electrical Distribution / Voltage Regulation", "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "id": "component:plant electrical distribution / voltage regulation"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Gradually increasing frequency of minor voltage-deviation indications across multiple pieces of equipment on the same branch; no single hard failure, but a clear worsening trend over the observation period.", "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "id": "symptom:gradually increasing frequency of minor voltage-deviation indications across multiple pieces of equipment on the same branch; no single hard failure, but a clear worsening trend over the observation period."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Increased overall load on the branch from other recently added equipment; a separate, coincidental issue at one piece of equipment initially masking the shared cause; transformer approaching end of service life generally.", "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "id": "root_cause:increased overall load on the branch from other recently added equipment; a separate, coincidental issue at one piece of equipment initially masking the shared cause; transformer approaching end of service life generally."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Facilities performed tap changer inspection and service on the branch supply transformer; confirmed voltage stability restored across all affected equipment.", "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "id": "solution:facilities performed tap changer inspection and service on the branch supply transformer; confirmed voltage stability restored across all affected equipment."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Robot Axis 1 / Servo Drive", "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "id": "component:robot axis 1 / servo drive"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Robot halted mid-traverse; teach pendant showed a momentary encoder-signal-loss indication; fault cleared on standard reset without further intervention on first occurrence.", "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "id": "symptom:robot halted mid-traverse; teach pendant showed a momentary encoder-signal-loss indication; fault cleared on standard reset without further intervention on first occurrence."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Encoder cable insulation damage from dress-pack rubbing; electrical noise coupling from an adjacent high-current cable; connector pin corrosion.", "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "id": "root_cause:encoder cable insulation damage from dress-pack rubbing; electrical noise coupling from an adjacent high-current cable; connector pin corrosion."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Reseated/re-terminated encoder connector; corrected cable routing and strain relief; verified signal stability across repeated cycles.", "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "id": "solution:reseated/re-terminated encoder connector; corrected cable routing and strain relief; verified signal stability across repeated cycles."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Teach Pendant / Emergency Stop Circuit", "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "id": "component:teach pendant / emergency stop circuit"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "E-stop plunger required extra force to press and occasionally stuck partway on return; safety status indicator briefly showed an inconsistent state during the check.", "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "id": "symptom:e-stop plunger required extra force to press and occasionally stuck partway on return; safety status indicator briefly showed an inconsistent state during the check."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Debris ingress into the plunger housing; spring fatigue from extended service life; prior physical damage to the pendant from a drop or impact.", "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "id": "root_cause:debris ingress into the plunger housing; spring fatigue from extended service life; prior physical damage to the pendant from a drop or impact."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced faulty pendant with a function-verified spare; sent faulty unit for E-stop switch assembly repair or replacement.", "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "id": "solution:replaced faulty pendant with a function-verified spare; sent faulty unit for e-stop switch assembly repair or replacement."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Shared Dress-Pack Cable Bundle", "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "id": "component:shared dress-pack cable bundle"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Robot I/O fault and gun sensor signal-loss fault occurring within moments of each other, specifically when the wrist reached certain orientations during the program; each fault individually appeared unrelated when reviewed on separate maintenance tickets.", "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "id": "symptom:robot i/o fault and gun sensor signal-loss fault occurring within moments of each other, specifically when the wrist reached certain orientations during the program; each fault individually appeared unrelated when reviewed on separate maintenance tickets."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Inadequate clamp support allowing excess bundle movement at the flex point; bundle routing not accounting for the full range of wrist motion used by the current program; a connector at the bundle junction box damaged rather than the cable run itself.", "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "id": "root_cause:inadequate clamp support allowing excess bundle movement at the flex point; bundle routing not accounting for the full range of wrist motion used by the current program; a connector at the bundle junction box damaged rather than the cable run itself."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Replaced damaged dress-pack bundle section; corrected routing/clamping; verified both signal types together across a full cycle.", "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "id": "solution:replaced damaged dress-pack bundle section; corrected routing/clamping; verified both signal types together across a full cycle."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Gun Servo Position Feedback", "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "id": "component:gun servo position feedback"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Gradual drift in logged closed-position feedback value across successive PM reviews; no production quality issue yet reported.", "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "id": "symptom:gradual drift in logged closed-position feedback value across successive pm reviews; no production quality issue yet reported."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Servo feedback sensor itself drifting independent of mechanical wear; electrode cap thickness change from recent dressing contributing a small offset; mounting bracket flexing slightly under repeated clamp load.", "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "id": "root_cause:servo feedback sensor itself drifting independent of mechanical wear; electrode cap thickness change from recent dressing contributing a small offset; mounting bracket flexing slightly under repeated clamp load."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Performed position/force calibration verification; adjusted closed-position reference to current baseline.", "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "id": "solution:performed position/force calibration verification; adjusted closed-position reference to current baseline."}, {"role": "component", "label": "Weld Sequence Parameters", "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "id": "component:weld sequence parameters"}, {"role": "symptom", "label": "Heavy spatter specifically at the new weld point from the earliest production parts; current and force setpoint magnitudes appeared correct when checked individually.", "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "id": "symptom:heavy spatter specifically at the new weld point from the earliest production parts; current and force setpoint magnitudes appeared correct when checked individually."}, {"role": "root_cause", "label": "Squeeze-time parameter set too short for this point's panel stack; a copy-paste error from a dissimilar reference schedule during initial programming; gun response time slightly slower than assumed by the sequencing design.", "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "id": "root_cause:squeeze-time parameter set too short for this point's panel stack; a copy-paste error from a dissimilar reference schedule during initial programming; gun response time slightly slower than assumed by the sequencing design."}, {"role": "solution", "label": "Corrected force-current sequencing timing; verified with destructive testing before full release.", "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "id": "solut