essed electrode to restore even geometry; confirmed current-variability trend stabilized over following week.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "source": "component:plant electrical distribution / voltage regulation", "target": "root_cause:increased overall load on the branch from other recently added equipment; a separate, coincidental issue at one piece of equipment initially masking the shared cause; transformer approaching end of service life generally.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "source": "symptom:gradually increasing frequency of minor voltage-deviation indications across multiple pieces of equipment on the same branch; no single hard failure, but a clear worsening trend over the observation period.", "target": "component:plant electrical distribution / voltage regulation", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["df3ce1b5-f483-4144-84f9-0d896dc8e133"], "source": "root_cause:increased overall load on the branch from other recently added equipment; a separate, coincidental issue at one piece of equipment initially masking the shared cause; transformer approaching end of service life generally.", "target": "solution:facilities performed tap changer inspection and service on the branch supply transformer; confirmed voltage stability restored across all affected equipment.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "source": "component:robot axis 1 / servo drive", "target": "root_cause:encoder cable insulation damage from dress-pack rubbing; electrical noise coupling from an adjacent high-current cable; connector pin corrosion.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "source": "symptom:robot halted mid-traverse; teach pendant showed a momentary encoder-signal-loss indication; fault cleared on standard reset without further intervention on first occurrence.", "target": "component:robot axis 1 / servo drive", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e6f050ac-41df-4a4b-8910-593af4c9402f"], "source": "root_cause:encoder cable insulation damage from dress-pack rubbing; electrical noise coupling from an adjacent high-current cable; connector pin corrosion.", "target": "solution:reseated/re-terminated encoder connector; corrected cable routing and strain relief; verified signal stability across repeated cycles.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "source": "component:teach pendant / emergency stop circuit", "target": "root_cause:debris ingress into the plunger housing; spring fatigue from extended service life; prior physical damage to the pendant from a drop or impact.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "source": "symptom:e-stop plunger required extra force to press and occasionally stuck partway on return; safety status indicator briefly showed an inconsistent state during the check.", "target": "component:teach pendant / emergency stop circuit", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["e7a97ee9-20ac-4a55-975f-bce5c2544786"], "source": "root_cause:debris ingress into the plunger housing; spring fatigue from extended service life; prior physical damage to the pendant from a drop or impact.", "target": "solution:replaced faulty pendant with a function-verified spare; sent faulty unit for e-stop switch assembly repair or replacement.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "source": "component:shared dress-pack cable bundle", "target": "root_cause:inadequate clamp support allowing excess bundle movement at the flex point; bundle routing not accounting for the full range of wrist motion used by the current program; a connector at the bundle junction box damaged rather than the cable run itself.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "source": "symptom:robot i/o fault and gun sensor signal-loss fault occurring within moments of each other, specifically when the wrist reached certain orientations during the program; each fault individually appeared unrelated when reviewed on separate maintenance tickets.", "target": "component:shared dress-pack cable bundle", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["ee9a9c8f-039a-40f5-8d71-945bb0418104"], "source": "root_cause:inadequate clamp support allowing excess bundle movement at the flex point; bundle routing not accounting for the full range of wrist motion used by the current program; a connector at the bundle junction box damaged rather than the cable run itself.", "target": "solution:replaced damaged dress-pack bundle section; corrected routing/clamping; verified both signal types together across a full cycle.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "source": "component:gun servo position feedback", "target": "root_cause:servo feedback sensor itself drifting independent of mechanical wear; electrode cap thickness change from recent dressing contributing a small offset; mounting bracket flexing slightly under repeated clamp load.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "source": "symptom:gradual drift in logged closed-position feedback value across successive pm reviews; no production quality issue yet reported.", "target": "component:gun servo position feedback", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["efa0a8a2-0b42-4aee-a877-8760fb541714"], "source": "root_cause:servo feedback sensor itself drifting independent of mechanical wear; electrode cap thickness change from recent dressing contributing a small offset; mounting bracket flexing slightly under repeated clamp load.", "target": "solution:performed position/force calibration verification; adjusted closed-position reference to current baseline.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "source": "component:weld sequence parameters", "target": "root_cause:squeeze-time parameter set too short for this point's panel stack; a copy-paste error from a dissimilar reference schedule during initial programming; gun response time slightly slower than assumed by the sequencing design.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "source": "symptom:heavy spatter specifically at the new weld point from the earliest production parts; current and force setpoint magnitudes appeared correct when checked individually.", "target": "component:weld sequence parameters", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["effc7188-1d91-4b35-8e4f-12bf84e2c5c7"], "source": "root_cause:squeeze-time parameter set too short for this point's panel stack; a copy-paste error from a dissimilar reference schedule during initial programming; gun response time slightly slower than assumed by the sequencing design.", "target": "solution:corrected force-current sequencing timing; verified with destructive testing before full release.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f09f20a1-6b10-44c9-902b-1d0ca7c554b8"], "source": "component:gun mechanical stop", "target": "root_cause:pin retention hardware loosened, allowing slight pin movement; open-speed setting higher than necessary, increasing impact severity and accelerating wear; incorrect stop pin installed at a prior service (wrong part).", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f09f20a1-6b10-44c9-902b-1d0ca7c554b8"], "source": "symptom:audible impact/clunk at full gun-open position; slightly excessive open travel visually noticeable compared to adjacent stations with the same gun type.", "target": "component:gun mechanical stop", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f09f20a1-6b10-44c9-902b-1d0ca7c554b8"], "source": "root_cause:pin retention hardware loosened, allowing slight pin movement; open-speed setting higher than necessary, increasing impact severity and accelerating wear; incorrect stop pin installed at a prior service (wrong part).", "target": "solution:replaced worn mechanical stop pin; verified open-travel distance; reduced open-speed setting to lessen future impact wear.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "caused_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f91814eb-8e1d-491f-8613-ca3c685451e2"], "source": "component:main compressed air header", "target": "root_cause:a partially closed header isolation valve unnecessarily restricting flow to this section; a developing leak elsewhere on the header compounding the capacity shortfall; compressor capacity itself marginal for total plant demand during peak periods.", "key": 0}, {"relation": "observed_on", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f91814eb-8e1d-491f-8613-ca3c685451e2"], "source": "symptom:clamp-force-related quality flags at multiple stations concentrated during a specific one-to-two-hour window each day shift; symptom largely absent during evening and night shifts with lower simultaneous pneumatic demand.", "target": "component:main compressed air header", "key": 0}, {"relation": "resolved_by", "weight": 1, "chunk_ids": ["f91814eb-8e1d-491f-8613-ca3c685451e2"], "source": "root_cause:a partially closed header isolation valve unnecessarily restricting flow to this section; a developing leak elsewhere on the header compounding the capacity shortfall; compressor capacity itself marginal for total plant demand during peak periods.", "target": "solution:installed local pressure accumulators at affected stations; coordinated with facilities on header capacity evaluation.", "key": 0}]}
</file>

